mapping "C629A.1" source="C629A" target="255107005" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source C629A SNOMED CT 255107005 = testicular cancer, seminoma (Swedish national-extension
        histology subcode of C62). Target 4114339 = Seminoma of testis, the matching histology concept.
        Source asserts seminoma histology without specifying laterality (descended/undescended); target
        covers all testicular seminoma regardless of laterality, so target subsumes source (broader).
        High tier (not): SNOMED CT-browser match on histology, no athena crosswalk at this
        Swedish-extension code (parent C62 crosswalk is one level up).
        """
}
