        histology subcode of C62). Target 4335110 = Non-seminomatous malignant neoplasm of testis, the
        matching histology concept. Source asserts non-seminoma histology without specifying laterality;
        target covers all non-seminomatous testicular malignancies regardless of laterality, so target
        subsumes source (broader). High tier (not): SNOMED CT-browser match on histology, no athena
        crosswalk at this Swedish-extension code (parent C62 crosswalk is one level up).
        """
}
